cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Data and code for "Environmental heterogeneity and the diversity of
  Neotropical frugivorous bats"
message: >-
  If you use this dataset or code, please cite both the archived release
  and the article it accompanies.
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Iván
    family-names: Hernández-Chávez
    affiliation: >-
      Posgrado en Ciencias Biológicas, Universidad Nacional Autónoma de
      México; and Laboratorio de Mastozoología Evolutiva y Colecciones
      Científicas, Facultad de Ciencias, UNAM
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000'   # [POR COMPLETAR]
  - given-names: Livia
    family-names: León-Paniagua
    email: llp@ciencias.unam.mx
    affiliation: >-
      Laboratorio de Mastozoología Evolutiva y Colecciones Científicas,
      Facultad de Ciencias, Universidad Nacional Autónoma de México
abstract: >-
  Curation pipeline, derived data tables and analysis code for a study of
  taxonomic and phylogenetic alpha and beta diversity of four frugivorous
  phyllostomid genera against present topographic heterogeneity and
  historical climatic instability, in equal-area cells of 50, 100 and 200 km
  across the Neotropics.
keywords:
  - environmental heterogeneity
  - beta diversity
  - phylogenetic diversity
  - Phyllostomidae
  - Neotropics
  - macroecology
